Package: newstan
Title: A Modern R Interface for Stan
Version: 0.1.4
Authors@R:
  person(given = c("Andrew", "R."), family = "Johnson", role = c("aut", "cre"),
          email = "andrew.johnson@arjohnsonau.com",
          comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7000-8065"))
Description:
    A modern, simpler R interface for Stan. Bundles the Stan headers
    internally and compiles models in-process, using the BH (Boost),
    RcppEigen (Eigen), and RcppParallel (TBB) packages for the required
    third-party headers and libraries.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Depends:
    R (>= 4.0)
Imports:
    R6,
    Rcpp (>= 1.0.0),
    RcppParallel,
    QuickJSR,
    posterior,
    withr,
    digest,
    jsonlite
LinkingTo:
    Rcpp,
    RcppEigen,
    BH,
    RcppParallel
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    loo,
    RcppEigen,
    BH
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/build/compilation-database: true
